      },
      "text": "By virtue of authority vested in me by \nsection 10 of the Railway Labor Act, as \namended (45 H  S. C. 160), Executive Or­\nder No. 10010 of October 18, 1948, en­\ntitled “Creating an Emergency Board to\nInvestigate Disputes between the Akron \n& Barberton Belt Railroad Company and \nOther Carriers, and Certain of Their Em­\nployees,”  is hereby amended as follows:"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2989,
      "char_start": 2630,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:10015#1",
      "kind": "item",
      "label": "1 .",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:10015#1",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "13 FR 6601, PDF pages 1-1",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "144846d6cda2b8c9f6722e6a42d7acdde89ef946502246330f45784df894f609",
        "signing_date": "1948-11-05",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_10015.txt",
        "text_sha256": "117838559ff84b610ca16bc986f1570765a5f85332a478a45707600352f482f1",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1948-11-09/pdf/FR-1948-11-09.pdf"
      },
      "text": "1 . The following-named carriers are \nhereby added to the list of carriers com­\nprising List A attached to and made a \npart of the said Executive order;\nThe New York & Long Branch Railroad  \nCompany\nWharton & Northern Railroad\nJersey Central Transportation Company\nGrand Central Terminals\nState University Railroad Company\nWoodstock & Blockton Railway Company"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 3466,
      "char_start": 2990,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:10015#2",
      "kind": "item",
      "label": "2.",
